<title>GERMANY: Siemens shares climb to new record.</title>
<headline>Siemens shares climb to new record.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Siemens AG on Monday climbed almost five percent to a new record high, gaining from a positive analysts meeting last week.</p>
<p>In early electronic trading Siemens rose 5.90 marks to 130.40.</p>
<p>Siemens last Thursday presented its nine-month results to analysts. It reported net income rose three percent to 1.705 billion marks, even though it had previously forecast no increase in 1996/97 profit.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
